  "limits": "These traces identify observed CPU allocator paths only. They do not cover all mmap, ART, graphics memory or private driver internals. The unwinder reports partial stacks; entries use the visible portion only. V8 attribution requires a matching ELF GNU Build ID and executable relative PC. Missing JS frames prevent assignment to a particular JS method. Native live bytes, V8 malloced memory and process PSS are separate metrics. Sampling perturbs execution and one profile per combination cannot establish a repeatable change or a cache leak.",
